                                                "sense_id": "7d0f7362-4103-3fa9-a23d-4a389ab63779",
                                                "text": "The Mob enforced the No-“H” Law. They tortured pushers. They killed them. Local hypes copped in L.A. Local hypes rode the Heroin Highway."
